{"id":52702,"ord":34,"n_segments":125,"prev":52701,"next":52703,"doc":{"id":"67296","title":"67296_Chauncey Morehouse oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Chauncey Morehouse","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/67296/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=67296"},"chapter":"Hutto 1978-79: family, favorites and record lists","title":"Going through the Paul Specht record list","category":"recording_session","summary":"Hutto reads Specht titles and Morehouse says which he played on; Ted Noyes replaced him on drums.","period":"1922-25","year_from":1922,"year_to":1922,"words":278,"start":[35,9],"end":[37,14],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=67296#s52702","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[],"bands":[{"name":"Paul Specht Orchestra","focus":1,"leader":"Paul Specht"},{"name":"Jean Goldkette Orchestra","focus":0,"leader":"Jean Goldkette"}]},"people":[{"name":"Russell Deppe","qid":null,"n":3},{"name":"Ted Noyes","qid":null,"n":2},{"name":"Paul Specht","qid":"Q7153718","n":1},{"name":"Roy Smeck","qid":"Q355788","n":1},{"name":"Cialito Linda","qid":null,"n":1}],"story":{"theme":42,"theme_name":"In the studio: making records, then and now","community":98,"community_name":"My first record date: sessions, personnel, discography","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":35,"b":9,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"Then the next drum is listed as Ted Noyes."},{"p":35,"b":10,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Ted Noyes, that's the guy that took my place."},{"p":35,"b":11,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"Well let's get into the Specht records and see how we do on that."},{"p":35,"b":12,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"Well, let's get all those."},{"p":35,"b":13,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"Okay. We don't get much chance on these."},{"p":35,"b":14,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"They're worth $3."},{"p":35,"b":15,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"Most any old record is worth $3. Okay on the Specht records - When Love Comes, When the Leaves Come Tumbling Down."},{"p":36,"b":0,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Yes, I did that."},{"p":36,"b":1,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"And \"Japanese Moon.\" Do you remember that?"},{"p":36,"b":2,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"\"Japanese Moon,\" yeah."},{"p":36,"b":3,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"All Muddled Up."},{"p":36,"b":4,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"All Muddled Up, yeah."},{"p":36,"b":5,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"\"Waltzing the Blues.\""},{"p":36,"b":6,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"\"Waltzing the Blues,\" yeah. That was a trick to play a \"waltzing blues\"."},{"p":36,"b":7,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"Now there is a skit, \"Chansonette\" and \"Easy Melody.\""},{"p":36,"b":8,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"I don't remember E..I remember \"Chansonette\" because that's almost like Chauncey net."},{"p":36,"b":9,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"So \"This Is Love\" and the Waltz of Long Ago.\""},{"p":36,"b":10,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"I don't remember that."},{"p":36,"b":11,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"It was Paul Specht Would you like to have them or what? The Paul Specht numbers."},{"p":36,"b":12,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Oh I would like to hear every record that I made."},{"p":36,"b":13,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"I think you mentioned that."},{"p":36,"b":14,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"\"Take Those Lips Away.\""},{"p":36,"b":15,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Am I listed on that?"},{"p":36,"b":16,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"Yup. \"Dear Old Lady.\""},{"p":36,"b":17,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"I don't remember those two. Maybe I didn't think so much of them."},{"p":36,"b":18,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"How about 'Solito London?'"},{"p":37,"b":0,"s":"","x":"\"Cielito Lindo\""},{"p":37,"b":1,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Cialito Linda, I did that."},{"p":37,"b":2,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"You did that. Let me write Okay."},{"p":37,"b":3,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Okay."},{"p":37,"b":4,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"Okay, \"I'm Going South\" and \"Where the Lazy Daisies Grow.\""},{"p":37,"b":5,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Yeah, \"the Lazy Daisies Grow....\""},{"p":37,"b":6,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"The Goldkette band did that."},{"p":37,"b":7,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":37,"b":8,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"And \"Worried\" and \"What'll I Do.\""},{"p":37,"b":9,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"\"Worried\" and \"What'll I Do\", yeah."},{"p":37,"b":10,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"\"Forget Me Not\" and \"From One Till Two\"."},{"p":37,"b":11,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"I don't remember that."},{"p":37,"b":12,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"Okay here's one where Smeck comes in to replace what Deppe, D-E-P-P-E."},{"p":37,"b":13,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Deppy."},{"p":37,"b":14,"s":"MR. HUTTO","x":"Deppy."}]}